lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并拟获最高10%股权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 发布生命科学专用模型 GPT-Rosalind 并向企业客户开放预览</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT女性用户占比首超50%且总用户规模逼近10亿大关</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini接入Google Photos，支持调用个人相册生成个性化图像</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布旗下AI助手Gemini正式支持连接用户个人相片库，通过开启Personal Intelligence功能，系统可整合谷歌应用数据以提供更个性化的交互体验。此次更新的核心在于打通了私人影像与AI生成能力的壁垒，配合图像生成工具Nano Banana，Gemini能够直接调取Google Photos中的私人相片，无需手动上传即可生成个性化图像内容。例如，用户可要求系统生成包含家人参与特定活动的动画风格图片，Gemini将自动完成创作。这一功能升级标志着AI图像生成从泛化模型向真正意义上的个人化应用迈进，通过深度集成用户私有数据，显著提升了AI助手在处理个性化视觉任务时的效率与精准度，为用户提供更具场景感和定制化的创作体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，支持单照生成90米环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/05507a6a0bc7555d5306882a7c31fc5d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队于2026年4月16日正式发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，该系统支持通过单张照片构建延伸范围达90米的高连贯性3D虚拟环境。针对传统视频模型在长距离相机路径下的空间失真与误差累积问题，Lyra2.0引入双重策略：实时存储3D几何信息以确保环境一致性，并利用带缺陷数据训练模型实现自我纠偏。基准测试显示，Lyra2.0在图像质量与相机控制维度优于GEN3C、Yume-1.5等六个竞品，快速版本生成效率提升13倍。目前，该系统已实现与Nvidia Isaac Sim等物理引擎的无缝衔接，生成的3D场景可直接导出为网格模型。这一技术突破降低了机器人对现实世界大规模3D数据采集的依赖，为自动驾驶及通用机器人（AGI）的仿真训练提供了高效的基础设施支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并拟获最高10%股权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已与芯片初创公司Cerebras达成协议，计划在未来三年内支付逾200亿美元采购其芯片驱动的服务器算力，并可能通过认股权证获得Cerebras最高10%的股权。此次合作除算力采购外，OpenAI还将额外提供约10亿美元资助Cerebras开发数据中心，预计未来三年总支出规模或达300亿美元。此前，双方已于今年1月签署价值超100亿美元的协议，采购最多750兆瓦计算能力。Cerebras以晶圆级引擎芯片技术见长，正筹备于今年二季度上市，并计划下月完成30亿美元融资，届时估值预计达350亿美元。此次深度绑定反映了OpenAI对推理算力的迫切需求，同时也为Cerebras的上市进程提供了核心支撑。Cerebras最快将于本周五披露更多协议细节。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布生命科学专用模型 GPT-Rosalind 并向企业客户开放预览</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 16 日正式发布专为生命科学研究打造的 AI 模型 GPT-Rosalind，旨在加速药物研发流程。该模型针对基因组学和化学领域进行深度微调，在 LABBench2 等科学基准测试中表现优异，部分预测任务已展现出超越人类专家的潜力。GPT-Rosalind 可协助科研人员完成证据合成、假设生成、实验规划及蛋白质工程分析，并配套支持链接超过 50 种专业科学工具与数据库的生命科学插件。目前，该模型已作为“研究预览”向安进（Amgen）、莫德纳（Moderna）、赛默飞世尔（Thermo Fisher Scientific）及艾伦研究所等首批合作伙伴开放。此举标志着 OpenAI 正式切入科学 AI 赛道，将 AI 能力从通用对话扩展至科研基础设施领域，引发医药行业对 AI 辅助研发模式的</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT女性用户占比首超50%且总用户规模逼近10亿大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d94ae718c271947526bf3fae3a9e6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI最新数据显示，ChatGPT用户性别结构发生历史性逆转，女性用户占比已突破50%，相较2022年发布初期的20%实现大幅增长。目前ChatGPT总用户规模正逼近10亿大关，其中女性活跃用户数已达约5亿。在算力基础设施方面，OpenAI扩张势头强劲，其可用算力从2023年的0.2吉瓦增长至2025年的约1.9吉瓦，两年间年增幅约3倍。为应对下一阶段AI竞争，OpenAI已与英伟达等合作伙伴签署超30吉瓦的算力协议，目标在2030年前将算力规模提升至30吉瓦。用户结构的多元化与算力储备的持续加码，标志着ChatGPT在消费级市场的渗透率及底层基础设施支撑能力均进入新阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
